# The Box64 that local realms' sessions run (scripts/build-box64.sh): Winlator's own version, 0.4.4,
# with warcraft/patches/box64/ applied, built for arm64 and put beside Winlator's as its built-in
# version BOX64_LEGION_VERSION (Winlator patch 0009). The games keep Winlator's.
